          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>There are $25 - 5 = 20$ acceptable washers. This is hypergeometric sampling: $P = \\dfrac{\\binom{20}{3}}{\\binom{25}{3}} = \\dfrac{1140}{2300} = 0.4957 \\approx 0.496$. Equivalently $\\frac{20}{25}\\cdot\\frac{19}{24}\\cdot\\frac{18}{23} = 0.496$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Có $25 - 5 = 20$ vòng đệm đạt yêu cầu. Đây là lấy mẫu siêu bội: $P = \\dfrac{\\binom{20}{3}}{\\binom{25}{3}} = \\dfrac{1140}{2300} = 0.4957 \\approx 0.496$. Tương đương $\\frac{20}{25}\\cdot\\frac{19}{24}\\cdot\\frac{18}{23} = 0.496$.</p></div>"
